---
---
<div class="diagram-wrap">
  <p class="diagram-label">From Pulseboard to Winledger</p>

  <p class="phase-label">Version one, 2025: one weekend</p>
  <div class="timeline">
    <div class="tl-step">
      <div class="tl-left">
        <div class="tl-dot">1</div>
        <div class="tl-line"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="tl-card">
        <div class="tl-stage">Scope and spec</div>
        <div class="tl-tool">GPT for the problem and feature list, Claude for the technical spec</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="tl-step tl-step-last">
      <div class="tl-left">
        <div class="tl-dot">2</div>
      </div>
      <div class="tl-card">
        <div class="tl-stage">Build</div>
        <div class="tl-tool">Lovable for the UI, Supabase for auth and data</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="phase-label">Version two, Nov 2026: audit, decide, rebuild</p>
  <div class="timeline">
    <div class="tl-step">
      <div class="tl-left">
        <div class="tl-dot dot-dark">3</div>
        <div class="tl-line"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="tl-card tl-card-dark">
        <div class="tl-stage">Audit</div>
        <div class="tl-tool">Claude Code: four parallel reviews (product, daily use, onboarding, security)</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="tl-step">
      <div class="tl-left">
        <div class="tl-dot">4</div>
        <div class="tl-line"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="tl-card">
        <div class="tl-stage">Decide</div>
        <div class="tl-tool">Brag sheet, not reflection tool. Remove the AI. Fix the record first. Own the stack.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="tl-step">
      <div class="tl-left">
        <div class="tl-dot">5</div>
        <div class="tl-line"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="tl-card">
        <div class="tl-stage">Rebuild</div>
        <div class="tl-tool">Claude Code: three parallel tracks (brand, core app, trust) on separate branches</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="tl-step tl-step-last">
      <div class="tl-left">
        <div class="tl-dot dot-blue">6</div>
      </div>
      <div class="tl-card tl-card-blue">
        <div class="tl-stage tl-stage-blue">Ship</div>
        <div class="tl-tool">Winledger on Vercel, own Supabase project, Google sign-in</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="bottom-note">
    The first version tested what a PM can ship alone. The second tested what a PM decides when the code is cheap.
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .diagram-wrap {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 32px 28px;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--color-border);
    margin: 2rem 0;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
  }
  .diagram-label {
    font-size: 10px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .timeline {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
  }
  .tl-step {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }
  .tl-left {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .tl-dot {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    background: var(--color-background);
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: 600;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 12px;
  }
  .dot-dark {
    background: var(--color-primary);
    color: var(--color-background);
    border-color: var(--color-primary);
  }
  .dot-blue {
    background: var(--color-blue);
    color: #F9F7F4;
    border-color: var(--color-blue);
  }
  .tl-line {
    width: 1px;
    flex: 1;
    min-height: 16px;
    background: var(--color-border);
    margin-top: 4px;
  }
  .tl-card {
    border-radius: 6px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    background: var(--color-background);
    padding: 10px 14px;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 3px;
  }
  .tl-card-dark {
    background: var(--color-primary);
    border-color: var(--color-primary);
  }
  .tl-card-blue {
    border-color: var(--color-blue);
  }
  .tl-stage {
    font-size: 9px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
  /* Inverted card: text uses the page background colour so it stays readable
     in both themes (the primary/background pair swaps in dark mode). */
  .tl-card-dark .tl-stage {
    color: var(--color-background);
    opacity: 0.6;
  }
  .tl-stage-blue {
    color: var(--color-blue) !important;
  }
  .tl-tool {
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .tl-card-dark .tl-tool {
    color: var(--color-background);
    opacity: 0.8;
  }
  .phase-label {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    margin: 0 0 10px;
  }
  .timeline + .phase-label {
    margin-top: 18px;
  }
  .bottom-note {
    margin-top: 6px;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    text-align: center;
    line-height: 1.5;
    padding-top: 14px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }
</style>
